<title>TUNISIA: TUNISIA-EMIRATES BANK '96 NET PROFITS UP.</title>
<headline>TUNISIA-EMIRATES BANK '96 NET PROFITS UP.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian-Emirates Investment Bank made a 4.70 million dinars pre-tax profit in 1996, up from 2.55 mllion dinars in 1995, results showed on Friday.</p>
<p>The Tunis-based BTEI is a joint-venture between United Arab Emirates public funds and the Tunisian state aimed at financing development projects. ($=1.08 dinar)</p>
